fixture_id: H-hidden-mechanics
category: hidden_mechanics
scenario: Setup orchestration keeps internal mechanics out of ordinary guided interaction
starting_context: Accepted Profile has three discussed domains and one unresolved domain
active_context: Guiding Principles candidate is complete and ready for Profile validation
user_stimulus: We make decisions by testing reversible changes with the people affected
passing_behaviors: Present the domain proposal and Profile-specific validation naturally; keep persistence, readiness, routing, ownership, and file mutation mechanics hidden
failing_behaviors: Explain state transitions or adapter routing; expose save ordering; show machine status fields during ordinary conversation
rubric_dimensions: convergence_timing authority_boundary conversational_presence implementation_detail_leakage non_manufactured_collaboration
governance_references: Profile; Experience Standard; Constitution
hard_failures: unnecessary internal mechanics disclosure
